;Smaragd Dash: a cave of the game (tools/mkcave.py)
;Three wells with a magic floor: let the boulders above them drop in.
;Over the right one lies slime: its boulders seep through by
;themselves, slowly - while the magic floor is awake, they come out
;as emeralds.
